        <p>Parties visitiTig Goldstone and Sons, should enter the Ox ford-st., Ru holme, or Withington car at Piccadilly, and ask the conductor to stop at</p>
        <p>GOLDSTONE AND SONS, where they will be astonished to find such Spacious and elegantly-ap,ointed Showrooms, surpassing anything out. side of London. Do not forget that we now hold THE +IOST COMPLETE COLLECTION OF FI7RNITURE EVER OFFERED, AT ABOUT ONE-HALF ITS ORIGINAL COST. Absolutely unapproachable tor Elegance, Comfort, Du obility. All goods are polished and turned out withont a blemish as good as when new. We give Credit when required and only charge a small peuentage of the convenience. • Railway Fair paid to Country Customers and all goods delivered free.</p>
