        <p>KIRKLAND BROS. BAKERS TO TIIE QUEEN, HAVE REMOVED FROM THE TOP TO THE BOTTOM OF BOLD-STREET, LIVERPOOL. KIRTLANDBROS., Purveyors to the Qneen by Royal Appointment, Have decided to use the FAMOUS GOLDEN TiP TEA. THIS TEA HAS BEEN SOLD AS litGH AS £lO PER LB, And notwithstanding that the cost will be very' great Messrs. Robert Roberts and Co , Tea Mer- chants, Bold-street, Liverpool, have been instructed to procure the Finest Teas in 'the market regarcUeo, of expense.</p>
      </div>
