m ss. 114. Special Fish Knives and Forks, 24 pieces, in strong wood case, with lock and key complete. 255. ; Chean White Metal Forks and Sp ,ons-Tea Spoons from 40. half-dozen ; Dessert Forks or Spoons from Ind. half-dozen; Table from is. 3d. halt-dozen. Pure Nickel Silver (Beet Quality only)- Tea Spoons, 94. half-dozen ; Dessert Forks or Spoons. 2s. 3d. half-dozen; Table, 2s. 30. hslf-dozen . • rtc. CUTLERY.-(English Made only).-Dessert Knives from Is. 7ird. half-doz. ; Table Knives, from Is. uS, half doz.; Car- vers, from 2s. 91 pair (best steel); Scissors, from sp. pair Pocket Knives from 54., &amp;e. CLOCK.- Debert's Clocks are the best value in the World. Always in stock over 5,000 Clocks of every description to select. from. Nickel Timepieces from Ls. 5d.; Alarms from Is. ; Wood Pendulum Clocks from 28. 11d. ; Regulators, from 128. 94., Kitchen Clocks (8 days), from 13s. 94.. to. OPTICAL GOODS.-Metal Barometers. ss. lid.; Wood Barometers, size 7 inch diameter, 7s. lid.; Do. do. with Thermometer combined. 7 inches by 18 inches, 10s. 6d.; do. do.. larger, 17s. 6d. to £3. FANCY GOODS.-Ladies' Companions from sp. to 255. Dressing Cases from Bs. 11d. to 538 (for Ladies or Gentle- men). Leather Purses from 4d. to 7s. 11d. Tobacco Pouches trom 5181. ; Cigar Cases from lOid. Ladies, Work Boxes from 10s. 6cl. Dolls from, 51.1. Tows from 50. Mouth Organs from 2d. Table Bells from 50. Ornaments and Figures from 5f4. Mirrors from 40. Dominoes trout 31d. Boys' Fretwork Tools, Outfit front 10d. Household Tools (5 pieces) from 100., . &amp;c. Above being only a few of the Articles kept in Stock, as would take mu 41 more space to mention everything, you are therefore invited to visit</p>
